This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-container-os layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Dependencies
============

Targets Yocto 6.0.4 (wrynose). See kas/qbee-cos/wrynose.common.yml for
the exact revisions used.

  URI: https://git.openembedded.org/bitbake
  URI: https://git.openembedded.org/openembedded-core
  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-yocto
  tag: yocto-6.0.4

  URI: https://git.openembedded.org/meta-openembedded
  layers: meta-oe, meta-python, meta-filesystems, meta-networking
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://github.com/rauc/meta-rauc.git
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-virtualization.git
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-security.git
  layers: meta-tpm
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://github.com/rauc/meta-rauc-community.git
  layers: meta-rauc-qemux86 / meta-rauc-raspberrypi
  branch: master (no wrynose branch exists, pinned to a commit)

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-raspberrypi.git (raspberrypi only)
  branch: wrynose

  URI: https://github.com/qbee-io/meta-qbee (meta-qbee layer)
  branch: master

